```

---

## Update Element

```python
arr[2] = 200
```

---

## Remove Element

### Remove by Index

```python
arr.pop(3)
```

### Remove by Value

```python
arr.remove(50)
```

---

## Reverse Array

```python
arr.reverse()
```

