```

---

# 12. Creating Arrays Quickly (NumPy)

### Zeros

```python
np.zeros(5)
```

Output

```
[0 0 0 0 0]
```

---

### Ones

```python
np.ones(5)
```

Output

```
[1 1 1 1 1]
```

---

### Full

```python
np.full(5, 7)
```

Output

```
[7 7 7 7 7]
```

---

### Arange

```python
np.arange(10,20,2)
```

Output

```
[10 12 14 16 18]
```

---

### Linspace

```python
np.linspace(10,20,5)
```

Output

```
[10 12.5 15 17.5 20]
```

